### Setup !!!
#
# REST Client extension (Huachao Mao) for VS code is needed
#

### Variables
# In DEV_MODE the auth header is ignored, so leave @token empty.
# For Firebase auth, paste an ID token (e.g. from the frontend) into @token.

@base  = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token =

### Generate (default character: Frank)
POST {{base}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "tell me about your day",
  "character": "Frank"
}

### Generate — Olivia
POST {{base}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "is it weird to eat cereal at 3am",
  "character": "Olivia"
}

### Generate — August
POST {{base}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "how was the standup?",
  "character": "August"
}

### Generate — Robert (TA)
POST {{base}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "can you re-explain the proof from lecture 4?",
  "character": "Robert"
}

### Generate — Professor James
POST {{base}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
